WEBVTT


00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:58.884
This is your captain speaking. We will
shortly be approaching Timmins Airport.


00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.791
Local time is 6:30.
It's a beautiful spring morning


00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:06.457
and the temperature is seven degrees
with occasional light snow flurries.


00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:12.472
I hope you've had a pleasant flight and will
enjoy your stay here in Northern Ontario.


00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:51.527
(woman) Can I get you some more coffee?


00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.478
(woman) Do you want more coffee?


00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:02.446
Yes, thank you,


00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:08.414
Do you mind if I sit here?


00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.285
No,


00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.653
(woman) Can I take your order?


00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:17.391
Yes, please,


00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.727
I'll have a Coke, please,


00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:22.257
Diet?


00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:26.863
Yeah, I've tried, it's just the no-eating part
that I struggle with,


00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:31.941
I'm kidding,


00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:34.479
I'll have a Diet Coke, yes,
Thanks,


00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:44.686
What you reading?


00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:49.359
Wipe The Slate, Light The Candle,


00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:53.794
- Is that a novel?
- Well,,,


00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.494
It's fiction,


00:03:56.569 --> 00:03:58.400
Hmm,


00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:03.233
I've been thinking of writing one of those,
You can make tons of money,


00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:07.609
All the gullible people out there,
searching for answers,


00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.114
I have the best title:


00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:13.050
The Bleeding Child Within,


00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:16.146
What do you think?


00:04:16.989 --> 00:04:19.549
It's very good,


00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:26.859
I don't know what particular area of human
pain or misery I'm gonna focus it on yet,


00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:29.026
I just like the title,
Thanks,


00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:31.832
I don't wanna waste it,


00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:38.233
(slurps)


00:04:39.645 --> 00:04:42.512
You're English, right?


00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:46.882
Look, you seem like a really chatty
kind of person and I don't want to be rude,


00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:49.444
but I'm not,,, chatty


00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:54.653
so perhaps you'd be better off
sitting somewhere else,


00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:56.991
Have you seen
some of these people?


00:04:57.063 --> 00:05:00.999
Well, there's a few
empty tables around,


00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:03.661
Do you wanna know
why I sat here?


00:05:03.736 --> 00:05:06.830
Because you look like a man
who needs to talk,


00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:11.104
You look like a guy
who hasn't talked in a really long time,


00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:16.014
- That's why you sat here?
- That is why I sat here,


00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:20.344
And because I need a lift,


00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.355
and you were the cleanest option,


00:05:24.924 --> 00:05:26.915
I'm sorry,


00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:30.452
Good luck,


00:05:44.644 --> 00:05:46.305
(alarm chirps)


00:06:11.037 --> 00:06:13.164
Change of heart?


00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:16.868
No, I just tried to change gear,
It's automatic,


00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:20.003
OK, Well, good luck,


00:06:27.086 --> 00:06:30.920
I'm driving to Winnipeg,
You'd better get out when I've had enough,


00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.925
Yes, Absolutely,
No problem,


00:06:39.599 --> 00:06:42.261
Bit of a drive, Winnipeg,


00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:47.300
- I'm Vivienne, by the way,
- Alex,


00:06:48.341 --> 00:06:51.174
I have to tell you,
I just got out of prison,


00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:54.410
Oh,


00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.038
