00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:00.652
I killed someone,


00:07:01.354 --> 00:07:03.015
OK,


00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:26.438
About this person you killed,,,


00:07:26.512 --> 00:07:30.312
I don't want to talk about it, I mentioned it
because I wanted you to be aware


00:07:30.383 --> 00:07:34.046
that ordinary-looking people
are often the ones you need to avoid,


00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.918
OK, Gotcha,


00:07:36.989 --> 00:07:39.719
Look out for the ordinary ones,


00:07:43.029 --> 00:07:46.521
So, are you feeling uneasy now?


00:07:46.599 --> 00:07:48.624
No,


00:07:48.701 --> 00:07:51.363
Sure?


00:07:51.437 --> 00:07:53.928
Well, maybe a little,


00:07:54.006 --> 00:07:56.236
Uneasy,
I tend not to visit scared,


00:07:56.309 --> 00:08:01.076
My mom's scared of everything and I've
made a conscious decision not to go there,


00:08:01.147 --> 00:08:05.447
If I hadn't been starving, I wouldn't have
stopped at that diner, That's frightening,


00:08:05.518 --> 00:08:09.682
You can't be afraid of tattoos and bad teeth,
It's part of their appeal,


00:08:09.755 --> 00:08:14.624
- I don't really think they'd hurt anyone,
- I was talking about the food,


00:08:15.428 --> 00:08:17.089
Oh,


00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:34.172
Have you got kids?


00:08:35.748 --> 00:08:39.809
- No,
- Really? At your age, no kids?


00:08:42.088 --> 00:08:44.386
Low sperm count?


00:08:44.457 --> 00:08:46.755
More of a low partner count,


00:08:46.826 --> 00:08:48.123
Ah,


00:08:48.194 --> 00:08:50.628
I know the feeling,


00:08:50.696 --> 00:08:53.164
Guys my age just don't like me,


00:08:54.133 --> 00:08:59.867
Mind you, you're quite an attractive-looking
guy, What's your excuse?


00:08:59.939 --> 00:09:02.430
I don't want to talk about it,


00:09:02.508 --> 00:09:04.976
There's a surprise,


00:09:14.186 --> 00:09:18.680
(man on radio) A lot of weather today
- variable conditions right across the area


00:09:18.758 --> 00:09:21.818
and I'm not sure if any of
the weather’s gonna be welcome.


00:09:21.894 --> 00:09:24.488
The one consolation is,
down in the southwest...


00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:39.639
(Vivienne) So, we're here,
sharing a meal,


00:09:40.646 --> 00:09:43.615
You know, if I was a few years older,
this would be a date,


00:09:43.683 --> 00:09:46.208
- A few? You're very generous,
- Mm-hmm,


00:09:46.285 --> 00:09:51.313
I know how the world works, I give a little
something, you give a little something,


00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:55.486
All right, all right, Both my parents are dead
and I have one brother,


00:09:55.561 --> 00:09:57.688
That wasn't so hard,


00:09:57.763 --> 00:10:00.527
He hates me,


00:10:00.599 --> 00:10:04.433
Whoa, there!
Nothing, and then the floodgates open,


00:10:05.071 --> 00:10:08.063
Go, Alex, Go, Alex,


00:10:09.608 --> 00:10:11.769
We're completely different,


00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:14.837
He's handsome and very fit,


00:10:15.848 --> 00:10:19.648
