00:10:28.394 --> 00:10:32.160
- Is that what they say?
- Yep, that's what they say,


00:10:32.231 --> 00:10:33.926
He's gay,


00:10:36.102 --> 00:10:38.093
That's my point exactly,


00:10:39.071 --> 00:10:42.336
