00:11:50.176 --> 00:11:54.408
She's gonna be beside herself
when she sees these,


00:11:56.215 --> 00:11:58.513
I can't wait to see her face,


00:11:59.185 --> 00:12:01.745
Oh, I love this song,


00:12:01.821 --> 00:12:04.289
