00:32:15.233 --> 00:32:17.292
You should try it,


00:32:33.084 --> 00:32:34.551
Hi,


00:32:35.319 --> 00:32:41.053
I heard about Vivienne,
I'm so sorry, I really liked her,


00:32:43.127 --> 00:32:46.722
